"吸附模式会在 Notes 移动后保持边栏贴边；独立模式不考虑 Notes 位置。" = "Docked mode keeps the Sidecar attached when Notes moves. Independent mode ignores the Notes window position.";
"正文颜色与玻璃透明度以系统动效设置为优先；Liquid Glass 在「减少透明度」下会退回不透明表面。" = "Text colors and glass transparency respect system accessibility settings. Liquid Glass falls back to opaque surfaces when Reduce Transparency is enabled.";
"⌥⌘N 是 Carbon 热运行，无论窗口与状态都会生效。⌥⌘R 与 ⇧⌘W 需要窗口处于按键状态。" = "⌥⌘N is a global Carbon hot key and works regardless of window state. ⌥⌘R and ⇧⌘W require the window to receive keyboard input.";
"扫描检测出常见 API Key / Token / App Secret / JWT / 私钥和个人信息后，敏感行不会提交给服务商，安全行仍可作为上下文。扫描出错则一律阻止请求。" = "The scanner detects common API keys, tokens, app secrets, JWTs, private keys, and personal information. Sensitive lines are never sent; safe lines may still be used as context. Any scan failure blocks the request.";
"只限本机对话历史；API Key、设置文件、Note 原文都未触及。" = "Applies only to local conversation history. API keys, settings, and original note content are not affected.";
"对话以原子 JSON 文件保存在 Application Support；API Key 单独保存在 macOS 钥匙串。沙箱后需要 app group 才能在 App 与主之间交叉读。" = "Conversations are stored as atomic JSON files in Application Support. API keys are stored separately in the macOS Keychain. A sandboxed build needs an app group for shared access.";
